    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "About CERAWeek 2020 CERAWeek 2020 will kick off Monday, March 9 at the Hilton Americas-Houston. CERAWeek by IHS Markit is the premier annual international gathering of energy industry leaders, experts, government officials and policymakers, leaders from the technology, financial and industrial communities – and energy technology innovators. Chaired by Daniel Yergin, CERAWeek 2020 will be the event’s 39th installment. Visit www.ceraweek.com for the most up-to-date event information and follow us via @CERAWeek. Listed session times, topics and speakers are subject to change."
